This directory contains Alembic database migrations for My Digital Twin.

Run commands from the backend directory:

    alembic current --check-heads
    alembic upgrade head
    alembic downgrade -1

For an existing Phase 2B SQLite database, do not run `alembic upgrade head`
directly the first time. Use:

    python -m app.migrations.phase3a_bootstrap_alembic

That command creates a backup, adopts the legacy schema at the baseline revision,
and applies the ownership-constraint normalization revision.
